es/api-spec.md` for detailed request headers, body, response, and data-flow notes.\n\n## Failure Handling\n\n- Invalid URL: ask for a product detail page.\n- Duplicate URL: submit once and report de-duplication.\n- Auth error: check local credentials; do not expose secrets.\n- Empty or timeout response: report network/service risk and avoid repeated submissions without user approval.\n\n## Configuration\n\nUse environment or host-provided credentials. Do not distribute real cookies, tokens, or `resources/config.json`.\n\r\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1781141116562},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The skill is installed but nested in a double directory. The proper path should be `/home/halei/workspace-tts/skills/miaoshou-erp-source-import/` but it currently is at `/home/halei/workspace-tts/skills/miaoshou-erp-source-import/miaoshou-erp-source-import/`. \n\nLet me fix the directory structure by moving the files up one level.\n","thinkingSignature":"333d37357887702d51e5b65978c946a0b5cfc02f67fc9cb71a59d82520dfc6f0"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nSkill 已存在，但目录嵌套了一层。帮你修正结构：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_4537801735044a0ca66d10f5","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/halei/workspace-tts/skills && mv miaoshou-erp-source-import/miaoshou-erp-source-import/* miaoshou-erp-source-import/ 2>/dev/null; rmdir miaoshou-erp-source-import/miaoshou-erp-source-import 2>/dev/null; ls -la miaoshou-erp-source-import/"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1677,"output":200,"cacheRead":65344,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":67221,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1781141116583,"responseId":"0679417d65cd632f868d9ed4ad3b5a0d"},{"truncated":true,"reason":"trajectory-array-size-limit","originalLength":67,"limitItems":64}],"imagesCount":0}}
