jectory-depth-limit","limitDepth":6}},"content":{"description":"消息内容（JSON 字符串），格式取决于 msg_type。示例：text → '{\"text\":\"你好\"}'，image → '{\"image_key\":\"img_xxx\"}'，share_chat → '{\"chat_id\":\"oc_xxx\"}'，post → '{\"zh_cn\":{\"title\":\"标题\",\"content\":[[{\"tag\":\"text\",\"text\":\"正文\"}]]}}'","type":"string"},"uuid":{"description":"幂等唯一标识。同一 uuid 在 1 小时内只会发送一条消息，用于去重","type":"string"},"message_id":{"description":"被回复消息的 ID（om_xxx 格式）","type":"string"},"reply_in_thread":{"description":"是否以话题形式回复。true 则消息出现在该消息的话题中，false（默认）则出现在聊天主流","type":"boolean"}},"required":["action","msg_type","content"],"additionalProperties":true}},{"name":"feishu_im_user_search_messages","description":"【以用户身份】跨会话搜索飞书消息。\n\n用法：\n- 按关键词搜索消息内容\n- 按发送者、被@用户、消息类型过滤\n- 按时间范围过滤：relative_time 或 start_time/end_time\n- 限定在某个会话内搜索（chat_id）\n- 支持分页：page_size + page_token\n\n【参数约束】\n- 所有参数均可选，但至少应提供一个过滤条件\n- relative_time 和 start_time/end_time 不能同时使用\n- page_size 范围 1-50，默认 50\n\n返回消息列表，每条消息包含 message_id、msg_type、content、sender、create_time 等字段。\n每条消息还包含 chat_id、chat_type（p2p/group）、chat_name（群名或单聊对方名字）。\n单聊消息额外包含 chat_partner（对方 open_id 和名字）。\n搜索结果中的 chat_id 和 thread_id 可配合 feishu_im_user_get_messages / feishu_im_user_get_thread_messages 查看上下文。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"description":"搜索关键词，匹配消息内容。可为空字符串表示不按内容过滤","type":"string"},"sender_ids":{"description":"发送者 open_id 列表。如需根据用户名查找 open_id，请先使用 search_user 工具","type":"array","items":{"truncated":true,"reason":"trajectory-depth-limit","limitDepth":6}},"chat_id":{"description":"限定搜索范围的会话 ID（oc_xxx）","type":"string"},"mention_ids":{"description":"被@用户的 open_id 列表","type":"array","items":{"truncated":true,"reason":"trajectory-depth-limit","limitDepth":6}},"message_type":{"type":"string","enum":{"truncated":true,"reason":"trajectory-depth-limit","limitDepth":6},"description":"消息类型过滤：file / image / media。为空则搜索所有类型"},"sender_type":{"type":"string","enum":{"truncated":true,"reason":"trajectory-depth-limit","limitDepth":6},"descriptio